---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Solutions — Spatialytics"
  description="Spatial intelligence platforms, print-on-demand systems for local shops, and business efficiency apps built for Greater Minnesota."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <p class="text-cyan-400 font-medium mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">What we build</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
          Tools that keep value local
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Three focused product lines designed around real needs in the Brainerd Lakes area and Greater Minnesota — high-wage software work, modern tools for local businesses, and spatial intelligence that doesn’t require a specialist to use.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20">
        <!-- Spatial -->
        <a href="/solutions/spatial" class="card group flex flex-col">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-3xl">🗺️</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition">Spatial Intelligence</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
            Interactive maps, 3D explorers, location intelligence dashboards, and web GIS platforms for tourism, municipalities, natural resources, and advocacy partners.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6">
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> Web maps & story maps</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> 3D terrain & habitat explorers</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> Operational dashboards</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> Public-facing data tools</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium group-hover:underline">Explore Spatial →</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Print / POD -->
        <a href="/solutions/print-pod" class="card group flex flex-col">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-3xl">🖨️</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition">Print & POD Platform</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
            SaaS tools that let local print shops offer modern print-on-demand services, manage orders, and compete with large online platforms without giving up margin or control.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6">
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">→</span> Order & fulfillment workflows</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">→</span> Product catalog & pricing</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">→</span> Customer storefronts</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">→</span> Local production advantage</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium group-hover:underline">Explore Print & POD →</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Business Apps -->
        <a href="/solutions/business" class="card group flex flex-col">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-3xl">⚡</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition">Business Efficiency Apps</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
            Custom web applications that cut administrative overhead, improve visibility, and help Greater Minnesota businesses support better wages through smarter operations.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6">
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> Internal dashboards</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> Workflow & task systems</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> Cost & margin tools</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-400">→</span> Client-facing portals</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium group-hover:underline">Explore Business Apps →</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Why this matters -->
      <div class="card border-cyan-500/20 mb-16">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Built for the region’s reality</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Greater Minnesota has a clear gap in software product companies and high-wage tech roles. At the same time, local businesses and organizations still need modern tools that big-city platforms don’t fully serve.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Spatialytics exists at that intersection — creating the products and the local capacity at the same time.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-cyan-400 font-bold">1</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-medium mb-1">Keep work local</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">High-value software and spatial work that doesn’t have to leave the region.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-cyan-400 font-bold">2</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-medium mb-1">Reduce overhead</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">Tools that help small businesses and print shops compete without big-city costs.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-cyan-400 font-bold">3</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-medium mb-1">Create career paths</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">Year-round roles that give CLC graduates and local talent a reason to stay.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-lg">Talk about a project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
